# kitchen_sink (Ruby)

Ruby bindings for `kitchen_sink` using the [ffi](https://github.com/ffi/ffi) gem.

## Prerequisites

- Ruby 2.7 or newer
- The native library (`libkitchen_sink.so`, `libkitchen_sink.dylib`, or `kitchen_sink.dll`) on the library
  search path, or its path in the `KITCHEN_SINK_LIBRARY` environment variable.

## Install

```bash
gem build kitchen_sink.gemspec
gem install kitchen_sink-0.1.0.gem
```

## Usage

```ruby
require 'kitchen_sink'

KitchenSink::ABI_VERSION
```

